_COMMON:0000125": {"L": "perichondrial fibroblast", "T": "class", "P": ["MOUSE_COMMON:0000011"], "R": ["Osr1"], "S": [], "N": [], "D": null, "DF": [], "A": [], "MP": [], "GM": {"Osr1": ["29084951", "21671783"]}, "GEN": 1}, "MOUSE_COMMON:0000047": {"L": "ciliated cell", "T": "class", "P": ["MOUSE_COMMON:0000190"], "R": [], "S": [], "N": [], "D": null, "DF": ["Dnaaf1", "Foxj1", "Dnah5", "Dnali1", "Cdhr3", "Dnah11", "Pifo", "Rsph1", "Tubb4a"], "A": [], "MP": [], "GM": {"Tubb4a": ["30069044"], "Dnaaf1": ["29228333"], "Foxj1": ["30069044"], "Dnah5": ["39594631"], "Dnali1": ["30069044"], "Cdhr3": ["30069044"], "Dnah11": ["30069044"], "Pifo": ["20643351"], "Rsph1": ["30896965"]}, "GEN": 1}, "MOUSE_COMMON:0000040": {"L": "basal cell", "T": "class", "P": ["MOUSE_COMMON:0000190"], "R": ["Trp63", "Krt14"], "S": [], "N": ["Acta2", "Foxj1"], "D": null, "DF": [], "A": [], "MP": [], "GM": {"Trp63": ["10227294", "19625615"], "Krt14": ["19625615", "7525178"]}, "GEN": 1}, "MOUSE_COMMON:0000078": {"L": "goblet cell", "T": "class", "P": ["MOUSE_TRACHEA:0000007"], "R": [], "S": [], "N": ["Foxj1", "Chga"], "D": null, "DF": ["Clca1", "Fcgbp", "Tff3", "Muc5ac", "Muc2", "Spdef", "Foxq1"], "A": [], "MP": [], "GM": {"Foxq1": ["18558092"], "Clca1": ["15947424", "31871532"], "Fcgbp": ["20703838"], "Tff3": ["20703838"], "Muc5ac": ["40446022"], "Muc2": ["20703838", "40072586"], "Spdef": ["25013930"]}, "GEN": 1}}, "cp": [["hillock cell vs club cell / airway basal cell", ["club cell"], "Krt13/Krt4 ON = hillock. Montoro 2018 (PMID 30069044): hillocks are stratified structures where Scgb1a1+Krt13+ luminal club-like cells sit on Trp63+Krt13+ basal cells; Krt13/Krt4 are OFF in pseudostratified club and basal cells at homeostasis."], ["goblet cell vs club cell", ["goblet-1 cell", "club cell"], "Both are Scgb1a1+ secretory (goblet cells were sub-clustered OUT of the club cluster in Montoro 2018). Goblet delta = Gp2/Foxq1/Muc5ac (+Tff1/Tff2 in goblet-1); club delta = Scgb3a2/Nfia."], ["submucosal gland myoepithelial cell vs airway basal cell", ["submucosal gland myoepithelial cell"], "Both Krt5+/Trp63+. Tata 2018 (PMID 29656943): ACTA2 is confined to SMG myoepithelial cells and SOX9 is a pan-SMG marker absent from the surface epithelium."], ["tuft-2 cell vs immune cell (Ptprc+)", [], "Montoro 2018: tuft-2 cells are enriched for the immune gene Ptprc (CD45). Ptprc is supporting-only here; the epithelial tuft identity must come from Trpm5/Rgs13/Alox5ap."], ["keratinocyte (skin/hair-follicle carry-over) vs hillock cell", [], "Hillock cell = airway Krt13/Krt4 cluster of the tracheal epithelium, Krt5+ and Trp63+, no cornified-envelope programme. Epidermal/hair-follicle keratinocytes (a common trachea-dissection carry-over, e.g. the 22-cell 'keratinocyte' cluster of Tabula Muris Senis FACS trachea) are Krt10/Krtdap/Sbsn/Sprr1a/Cnfn/Lgals7 high, carry hair keratins (Krt35, Krt24) and Prss53, and are Trp63-negative. Krt13/Krt4 alone therefore must NOT be used to call hillock cell."], ["chondrocyte vs submucosal gland myoepithelial cell (shared Sox9)", ["submucosal gland myoepithelial cell"], "Sox9 is required for both. Chondrocyte is separated by Col2a1 + Acan (cartilage matrix, absent from airway epithelium); SMG myoepithelial cell by Acta2 + Krt5."], ["chondrocyte vs perichondrial fibroblast", [], "Chad, Wif1, Clu and Cytl1 look like top chondrocyte markers in dissociated adult mouse trachea but Calyeca 2025 (PMID 39836476) assigns them to perichondral fibroblasts: 'perichondral Fb (PC-Fb) (Cluster 3: Chad, Wif1, Clu, Cytl1, Hspb1)'. True chondrocyte discriminators are Col2a1 and Acan."], ["squamous basal cell vs hillock cell", ["squamous/hillock-like basal cell (Krt13+)"], "Both carry Krt13/Krt4. Hillock cell keeps Krt13/Krt4 as DEFINING; squamous basal cell is keyed on Krt6a/Sprr2a3 with Krt13/Krt4 demoted to supporting (INV-3). Basal identity (Krt5/Trp63, inherited from MOUSE_TRACHEA:0000001) is the tie-breaker: hillock cells are luminal-layer Krt13+ and only weakly Trp63."], ["adventitial fibroblast vs Cthrc1-activated fibroblast vs immune-recruiting fibroblast", [], "Cthrc1+ Fb and IR-Fb are surgery-induced-stress STATES derived from Adventitial-Fb (Calyeca 2025), so they share the adventitial baseline. Cthrc1 (fibrotic) and Cxcl10 (interferon/immune-recruiting) are the state discriminators; Clec3b/Pcolce2/Pi16 mark the resting adventitial identity."]], "oq": ["MOUSE_TRACHEA:0000003", "MOUSE_TRACHEA:0000016", "MOUSE_TRACHEA:0000006", "MOUSE_TRACHEA:0000001", "MOUSE_TRACHEA:0000017", "MOUSE_TRACHEA:0000018", "MOUSE_TRACHEA:0000014", "MOUSE_TRACHEA:0000025", "MOUSE_TRACHEA:0000024", "MOUSE_TRACHEA:0000029"], "ca": [{"name": "tracheal dorsoventral axis", "applies_to": ["basal cell"], "poles": [{"pole": "ventral (cartilage-facing)", "context_markers": ["Col2a1", "Acan", "Sox9", "Chad", "Wif1", "Cytl1"], "subtypes": {"basal cell": "ventral basal cell"}}, {"pole": "dorsal (trachealis muscle-facing)", "context_markers": ["Myh11", "Acta2", "Cnn1", "Tagln"], "subtypes": {"basal cell": "dorsal basal cell"}}], "pmids": ["36178196", "32286221", "39836476"]}], "sa": [{"name": "osteoclastogenic RANKL program", "markers": ["TNFSF11", "ETS1"], "pmids": ["40136507", "38554844"], "applies_to": ["mesenchymal cell"], "mimics": [], "anchor_markers": [], "of": []}, {"name": "proliferating", "markers": ["MKI67", "TOP2A", "CCNB1", "CENPF"], "pmids": ["12058064"], "applies_to": [], "mimics": [], "anchor_markers": [], "of": ["adipose stem and progenitor cell", "myofibroblast", "endothelial cell", "macrophage", "fibroblast", "basal keratinocyte", "basal cell", "group 2 innate lymphoid cell", "skeletal muscle satellite cell"]}, {"name": "immunomodulatory", "markers": ["LIF", "IL6", "IL11"], "pmids": ["28232471"], "applies_to": ["fibroblast"], "mimics": [], "anchor_markers": [], "of": []}, {"name": "senescent", "markers": ["CDKN1A", "CDKN2A", "GLB1", "SERPINE1"], "pmids": ["29477613"], "applies_to": [], "mimics": [], "anchor_markers": [], "of": ["T cell", 